---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | CalcMyLoan"
  description="Read the Privacy Policy for CalcMyLoan, including details on client-side data processing, cookies, and Google AdSense advertising."
>
  <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto prose text-slate-700 space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last Updated: November 2026</p>

    <p>
      At <strong>CalcMyLoan.com</strong>, the privacy of our visitors is a top priority. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information collected and recorded by CalcMyLoan and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Client-Side Calculator Data</h2>
    <p>
      All calculations and PDF amortization schedules generated on CalcMyLoan run locally within your web browser using JavaScript. The financial figures you enter (such as home prices, loan balances, or interest rates) are never transmitted to or stored on our servers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Log Files and Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Like most standard websites, CalcMyLoan follows a standard procedure of using server log files and privacy-friendly analytics. Information collected may include internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamps, referring/exit pages, and click counts. This data is not linked to any personally identifiable information.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Google AdSense and Advertising Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to display advertisements and keep our tools free for all users. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies (including the DoubleClick DART cookie) to serve ads to users based on their visit to CalcMyLoan.com and other websites on the internet.
    </p>
    <p>
      Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Google Ads Settings</a> or by visiting <a href="https://aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">www.aboutads.info</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. GDPR & CCPA Privacy Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on your location, you have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we may hold, as well as the right to opt out of data sharing for targeted advertising. Because we do not require user accounts or store form inputs, we hold no personal user profiles.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Consent</h2>
    <p>
      By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms. If you have questions about this policy, please reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 underline">Contact Page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>